      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "In September 2016, he visited Washington, D.C., and met with Mayor Muriel Bowser to discuss urban-development projects.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386788384:72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Nayib Bukele was born on 24 July 1981 in San Salvador.",
